% podman-manifest-list 1

## NAME
podman\-manifest\-list - List manifest lists and image indexes in local storage

## SYNOPSIS
**podman manifest list** [*options*]

**podman manifest ls** [*options*]

## DESCRIPTION

List manifest lists and image indexes stored in local container storage.

## OPTIONS

#### **--format**, **-f**=*format*

Change the default output format.  This can be of a supported type like 'json'
or a Go template.
Valid placeholders for the Go template are listed below:

| **Placeholder** | **Description**                                      |
| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |
| .Created        | Elapsed time since the manifest list was created     |
| .CreatedAt      | Creation date and time of the manifest list          |
| .Digest         | Manifest list digest                                 |
| .ID             | Manifest list ID                                     |
| .Repository     | Manifest list repository                             |
| .Tag            | Manifest list tag                                    |

#### **--help**

Print usage statement.

@@option no-trunc

@@option noheading

#### **--quiet**, **-q**

Only print the manifest list IDs. This also implies no table heading
is printed. This option cannot be combined with **--format**.

## EXAMPLES

List all manifest lists and image indexes in local storage.
```
$ podman manifest list
REPOSITORY         TAG         IMAGE ID      CREATED
localhost/mylist   latest      d663aec00035  2 weeks ago
localhost/myindex  v1.0        ea058213e301  2 weeks ago
```
List all Podman manifest lists using the specified table format.
```
$ podman manifest list --format "table {{.ID}}\t{{.Repository}}\t{{.Tag}}"
IMAGE ID      REPOSITORY         TAG
d663aec00035  localhost/mylist   latest
ea058213e301  localhost/myindex  v1.0
```
List all Podman manifest lists in json format.
```
$ podman manifest list --format json
[
